# Curated 3-line Lyn Rummy puzzles.
#
# Generated 2026-05-22 from agent self-play across seeds 1–30.
# Each board is a dirty state that the BFS solver resolves in exactly
# 3 verb-level moves — the second-easiest tier. Curated for variety
# (one puzzle per verb-multiset), then ordered by total cards on the
# board (fewest first). Names encode the sorted verb-multiset +
# provenance (s<seed>t<turn>p<player>).
#
# Format matches curated_4line_puzzles.dsl. UI: views/puzzle.go consumes
# directly. No conformance — these are surfacing-only puzzles.

